# Experimental local-only candidate against teamleaderleo/FEX @ 71afe476751deac24adabd1adb575fd2337b6e0a
# Purpose: remove thunk CustomIR redirections whose captured guest target is unmapped,
# and invalidate the synthetic native-PFN lookup-cache keys in one batched operation.
# This is research code. Full FEX compilation was unavailable in this sandbox because the
# complete checkout could not be materialized; the matching lifecycle semantics are built
# and executed by custom_ir_lifetime_probe.cpp.

